            0.084,
            0.882,
            0.124
          ],
          "content": " Add 2–3 teaspoons of water to each test tube and shake them well."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.13,
            0.883,
            0.172
          ],
          "content": " Add two drops of copper sulfate solution to each test tube using a dropper."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.176,
            0.883,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": " Now, take another dropper and add 10 drops of caustic soda solution to each tube (Fig. 3.8)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.223,
            0.883,
            0.264
          ],
          "content": " Shake well and leave the test tubes undisturbed for a few minutes."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.301,
            0.277,
            0.878,
            0.576
          ],
